From: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] security(bolt-ui): prevent command injection in E2B API

Fixes critical command injection vulnerability in E2B proxy API.
Attackers could execute arbitrary shell commands via path parameter.

Changes:
- Add escapeShellArg() function using single-quote escaping
- Apply escaping to all shell command parameters
- Add security tests for injection vectors

SECURITY: CVE-2026-XXXXX (to be assigned)
Severity: CRITICAL
CVSS: 9.8 (Network/Low/None/Un/Changed/High/High/High)

